    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n68746" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μορέω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μόρος</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>make with pain and
			toil</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὃν ἁπάτωρ . . μόρησε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dosiad.
					<u>Ara</u>
					8
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				584.31
			</span></i> (sed leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μόγησε</span>)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">; πυρὸς μεμορημένος αὐγαῖς</span>, i. e.
				<i>boiled</i> over a fire, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Al.</u>
				229
			</span></i> (unless from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μείρομαι</span> (A),
			q. v.).</div>
